WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:06.037
Computer Fundamentals What is a
computer? A computer is an electronics

00:00:06.061 --> 00:00:17.880
machine which helps to solve problems easily
Parts of a computer Monitor CPU Keyboard

00:00:17.881 --> 00:00:25.320
Mouse Speaker are the main parts
of a computer Types of computer

00:00:25.321 --> 00:00:28.593
Desktop computer,
laptop computer, tablet,

00:00:28.617 --> 00:00:32.292
palm-top computer, smart
phones, are some types

00:00:32.504 --> 00:00:40.160
of computer Father of computer Charles
Babbage is known as the Father of computer

00:00:40.161 --> 00:00:46.400
Hardware and software Computer
is made up of hardware, and software

00:00:46.401 --> 00:00:50.640
Computer hardware is any part
of the computer, that we can touch

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:55.525
Examples of computer
hardware are monitor, CPU,

00:00:55.549 --> 00:00:59.592
keyboard, motherboard,
printer, scanner, speaker

00:00:59.779 --> 00:01:05.700
Computer software is the set of
instructions, that makes the computer to work

00:01:05.701 --> 00:01:09.496
Examples of computer
software are PowerPoint,

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:17.100
Android, Microsoft Word, Windows, Java,
Google Chrome, Gmail, anti-virus software

00:01:17.101 --> 00:01:26.860
Power computer works Computer works in
three basic steps Input, process, and output

00:01:26.861 --> 00:01:30.160
Input is the data that we
enter into the computer

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:33.560
Process is what the computer
does with the input data

00:01:33.759 --> 00:01:38.640
Output is the final result the computer
gives to us after processing the data

00:01:38.641 --> 00:01:44.360
Input devices Input devices are
used to give data into the computer

00:01:44.361 --> 00:01:49.840
Examples of input devices are
keyboard, mouse, joystick, microphone,

00:01:49.841 --> 00:01:54.640
light pen, scanner
Output devices

00:01:54.641 --> 00:01:58.720
Output device are used to get
information from the computer

00:01:58.721 --> 00:02:03.312
Examples of output
devices are monitor, printer,

00:02:03.313 --> 00:02:07.800
projector, headphone,
speaker Computer language

00:02:07.801 --> 00:02:11.495
Machine language is the only
language a computer is capable

00:02:11.496 --> 00:02:15.480
of understanding It is also
called low-level language

00:02:15.481 --> 00:02:22.520
Machine language is a collection of 0 and
1 0 and 1 are called binary digits or bits

00:02:22.521 --> 00:02:27.600
It is very difficult to understand
by human Uses of computer

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:32.189
Computer is used to study,
listen to music, watch movies, play

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:39.440
games, draw pictures, chat, send
emails, and surf in the internet

00:02:39.441 --> 00:02:45.760
Computer in our daily life, computers are
used in schools, hospitals, offices, home,

00:02:45.761 --> 00:02:53.760
banks, and airports Advantages of computer
A computer does accurate calculations

00:02:53.761 --> 00:02:58.560
A computer does not get tired
It can do many tasks at a time

00:02:58.561 --> 00:03:04.040
It does not forget any information
A computer works very fast

00:03:04.041 --> 00:03:08.762
Disadvantages of computer
A computer does not

00:03:08.763 --> 00:03:12.960
have feelings It cannot
take its own decision

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:37.840
A computer works on a user's order, question
time The following in the correct circle

